// Powered rail: copperline laid along the track drives a cart while it carries current. A cart at the foot
// of a 1-in-3 climb sits still on plain power-off track; throw the lever and the motor pulls it up the slope
// (plain track can't: gravity and friction would hold it at the bottom), out along the top, into the
// bumper, and back down: a powered line between two bumpers shuttles. Lever off while it runs down, and it
// coasts to the foot and stops there.
map
##################################
#................................#
#................................#
#..............@.................#
#...........#######..............#
#................................#
#........................======###
#.....................===#########
#..................===############
#...............===###############
#............===##################
#.........===#####################
#=========########################
##################################
##################################
##################################
end
give Cart 1
give CopperWire 60
wire 2 -14 9
wire 2 -13 9
wire 2 -12 9
wire 2 -11 9
wire 2 -10 9
wire 2 -9 9
wire 2 -8 9
wire 2 -7 9
wire 2 -6 9
wire 2 -5 9
wire 2 -5 8
wire 2 -4 8
wire 2 -3 8
wire 2 -2 8
wire 2 -2 7
wire 2 -1 7
wire 2 0 7
wire 2 1 7
wire 2 1 6
wire 2 2 6
wire 2 3 6
wire 2 4 6
wire 2 4 5
wire 2 5 5
wire 2 6 5
wire 2 7 5
wire 2 7 4
wire 2 8 4
wire 2 9 4
wire 2 10 4
wire 2 10 3
wire 2 11 3
wire 2 12 3
wire 2 13 3
wire 2 14 3
wire 2 15 3
device 2 -13 5 Lever              // beside the start of the line
place 3 -12 8 Cart                // at the foot of the climb
expect 5 cartrail == 1
expect 60 cartv == 0              // no current: it sits there
use 70 -13 5                      // lever on
expect 160 cartx > 18             // pulled up the slope...
expect 160 carty < 9              // ...climbing (tiles from the map top: smaller is higher)
expect 200 cartx > 28             // up on the top level, into the bumper
expect 280 cartx < 12             // and driven back down the other way: the line shuttles
use 300 -13 5                     // lever off while it runs down
expect 600 cartv == 0             // it coasts to the foot and stops there
expect 600 cartx < 9
expect 600 cartrail == 1
